WEBVTT

00:06:58.934 --> 00:07:00.177
so that was a problem.

00:07:00.201 --> 00:07:01.848
(Laughter)

00:07:01.872 --> 00:07:03.847
What does it mean to be yourself?

00:07:04.313 --> 00:07:06.182
People say it all the time,

00:07:06.206 --> 00:07:07.896
but what does it truly mean,

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:09.346
and why does it matter?

00:07:10.257 --> 00:07:14.465
How does life change when you choose
to be unapologetically yourself?

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:20.466
I've had to face struggles
and triumphs whilst living my life as art.

00:07:20.490 --> 00:07:22.730
I've been put on private jets

00:07:22.754 --> 00:07:24.329
and flown around the world.

00:07:24.724 --> 00:07:26.957
My work's been displayed
in prestigious museums,

00:07:26.971 --> 00:07:28.448
and I've had the opportunity --

00:07:28.472 --> 00:07:31.204
that is my grandparents, by the way,